@[Welcome to the SMGL @ENCHANT_ISO_VERSION@ install iso!]
This is the guided shell prompt enchantment (installer).

To see the list of all steps: @[list] (or @[steps]).
To see the list of all commands: @[help]. To show the current step's
instructions again: @[todo].
To see this message again: @[welcome].

To set a different keymap: @[keymap]
  (or @[539], which types the same on any keyboard layout).

On a laptop? @[acpi -b] shows the battery charge; keep an eye on it.

No network is needed to install. To get online, or to install over SSH from
another computer: @[guide network]

If you have any feedback for us, please drop by #sourcemage-cauldron
on irc.libera.chat, file a bug on bugs.sourcemage.org,
or just send an email to the mailing lists or to iso@sourcemage.org.

Enter @[next] to advance to the next step in the installation.
Have fun!
